<div class="eng"><div class="lab">GESHE MICHAEL'S ENGLISH (VERBATIM)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s225S">The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w1">first</span> of these positions belongs to a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w3">certain group</span> within the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w2">Mind-Only School</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w4">second</span> position is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w7">explained</span> by Master <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w6">Avalokitavrata</span> to be that of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w5">Detailist School</span>--of a certain section <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w11">other</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w10">than</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w8">Kashmiri</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w9">Detailists</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w12">third</span> position <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w13">also</span> belongs to a specific <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w15">group</span> within the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w14">Detailist School</span>. It is <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w18">not</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w17">completely clear</span> where the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w16">fourth</span> position belongs, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w19">but</span> since it is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w24">consistent</span> with the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w23">ninth</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w22">chapter</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w21">autocommentary</span> to the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w20">Treasure House of Knowledge</span> (Abhidharmakosha), it <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s225w30">would appear to be</span> an alternate <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w29">belief</span> of the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w25">Sutrists</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s225w26">and</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w27">Kashmiri</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s225w28">Detailists</span>.</span>
